ge. The prompt should include details such as character appearance, main content, scene setting, style reference, additional details, composition, and other necessary details. Specifically, the description of the image's subject, character body movements and expressions, and behavioral actions should be natural and coherent. The content related to the image style, lighting, and spatial composition should be described in short phrases. Combine these elements into a single paragraph"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 399, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 291, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["```\n|欢迎关注我的主页|AI小学徒\n有超多实用的工作流进行分享，你也可以评论告诉我想要的工作流，我会尽可能去实现\n```\n---\n\n### RH主页直达：[AI小学徒](https://www.runninghub.cn/user-center/1862343910537273346/webapp?inviteCode=1ac7d3f2 )👈\n### 下面是一些常用工作流\n### 实用工作流直达：[电商融图打光Flux2模型](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/2019299607712370689 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[产品精修](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1946789807444881409 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[高清放大](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1950100460037390337 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[皮肤还原](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/1991358082580328449 )👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[动作迁移](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/1991572773659222018)👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[影调模仿](https://www.runninghub.cn/ai-detail/2001301024411447297)👈\n### 实用工作流直达：[白膜渲染](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/1974672182938873858)👈\n\n点击以上链接即可。\n持续更新中~感谢大家支持🥰。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [355.9222412109375, 534.1090087890625], "pos": [-455.6320495605469, 4254.14013671875], "id": 312, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "wi